Third-party software
--------------------

This repository may include third-party open-source software,
vendored source code, build scripts, generated artifacts, frontend
dependencies, documentation tooling, and optional runtime components.
Third-party components remain subject to their own license terms.

Third-party dependency review is tracked in:

  docs/project/third-party-licenses.md

Maintainers should complete the third-party license audit before a
formal public release and expand this NOTICE file with required
third-party attribution notices.

Initial components identified for release review include, but are not
limited to:

  - FFmpeg
  - OpenH264
  - OpenSSL
  - curl
  - Paho MQTT C
  - SRS
  - ONNX Runtime
  - Sophon SDK/runtime components
  - Vue/Vite/VitePress and frontend npm dependencies

Codec and binary distribution notice
------------------------------------

Public release builds should document whether GPL codec support is
disabled or enabled. Enabling GPL codec components can change
redistribution obligations.

Prebuilt binaries, model packages, tokenizer resources, and sample
media must be reviewed separately before publication.
